  <content>
    <section>
      <title>Activity</title>
      
      <note>
      <para>Access the <link
          url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/b62c9150250bf52d6cc37569213ab516e0090dca">Desmos
        guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
      </note>

      <para>Here is a graph that represents solutions to the equation \(x−y=5\).</para>
      <para>Using this graph as a guide, sketch a quick graph that represents the solutions to each
        of the inequalities in questions 1 – 4. Use the graphing tool or technology outside the
        course. Graph the equation that represents each scenario using the Desmos tool provided.</para>
      <para>
        <figure class="unnumbered">
          <media
            alt="Graph of a line, origin O, no grid. Scale is negative 10 to 5, by 5's on both axes. Line passes through 0 comma negative 5 and 5 comma 0.">
            <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_06_01.svg" />
          </media>
        </figure>
      </para>
      <!--Q1-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>\(x−y&lt;5 \)</para>
          <media alt="">
          <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
            height="400" />
          </media>
          <para>When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>
            <figure class="unnumbered">
              <media alt="Graph of an inequality.">
                <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_06_02.svg" />
              </media>
            </figure>
          </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Interaction
      End -->
      <!--Q2-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>\( x−y \leq 5\)</para>
          <media alt="">
          <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
            height="400" />
          </media>
          <para>When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>
            <figure class="unnumbered">
              <media alt="Graph of an inequality.">
                <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_06_03.svg" />
              </media>
            </figure>
          </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Interaction
      End -->
      <!--Q3-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>\(x−y&gt;5\)</para>
          <media alt="">
          <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
            height="400" />
            </media>
          <para>When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>
            <figure class="unnumbered">
              <media alt="Graph of an inequality.">
                <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_06_04.svg" />
              </media>
            </figure>
          </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <!--Interaction
      End -->
      <!--Q4-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>\(x−y \geq 5\) </para>
          <media alt="">
            <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500"
              height="400" />
              </media>
          <para>When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>
            <figure class="unnumbered">
              <media alt="Graph of an inequality.">
                <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_02_13_06_05.svg" />
